_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-10076-12","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-10076-13","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-10076-14","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-10076-15","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-10076-16","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-10076-17","text":"↩︎","title":""}],"plainText":"选自《全唐诗》卷二十一(中华书局1999 年版)。 春江花月夜,乐府旧题。张若虚(约660—约720),扬州(今属江苏)人,唐代诗人。与贺知章、张旭、包融并称“吴中四士”。 春江潮水连海平,海上明月共潮生。 滟滟[1]随波千万里,何处春江无月明[2]。 江流宛转绕芳甸[3],月照花林皆似霰[4]。 空里流霜[5]不觉飞,汀上白沙看不见。 江天一色无纤尘,皎皎空中孤月轮。 江畔何人初见月?江月何年初照人? 人生代代无穷已,江月年年望相似。 不知江月待何人,但见长江送流水。 白云一片去悠悠,青枫浦[6]上不胜愁。 谁家今夜扁舟子[7]?何处相思明月楼[8]? 可怜楼上月裴回[9],应照离人[10]妆镜台。 玉户帘中卷不去[11],捣衣砧上拂还来。 此时相望不相闻,愿逐月华[12]流照[13]君。 鸿雁长飞光不度[14],鱼龙潜跃水成文[15]。 昨夜闲潭梦落花,可怜春半不还家。 江水流春去欲尽,江潭落月复西斜。 斜月沉沉藏海雾,碣石潇湘[16]无限路。 不知乘月几人归,落月摇情满江树[17]。 这首诗以月升、月悬、月斜、月落为线索, 贯串叙事、写景、议论、抒情,把春、江、花、月、夜的景色和情理融为一体,空灵而美妙; 而所有场景的转换都有内在的连续性,自然而流畅。 毫无疑问,这一切是因为人的观照: 人对美景的赏鉴和美景对人的情思的启发, 自然的恒久与个体生命的短暂, 游子的离情别绪和亲人的相思之苦, 交互感发,让人心旌摇荡。 诵读这首诗,感受诗人以月为核心意象营造出的空灵曼妙的意境,体会其中寄寓的情怀和哲思。 春江花月夜 [清]袁江 作 drive.google.com 闻一多全集 06 唐诗编 上(湖北人民出版社1993).pdf Google Drive file. This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%98%a5%e6%b1%9f%e8%8a%b1%e6%9c%88%e5%a4%9c%e5%bc%a0%e8%8b%a5%e8%99%9a [color=red] 滟滟:形容波光荡漾。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 月明:月光。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 芳甸:花草茂盛的原野。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 霰(xiàn):白色不透明的小冰粒。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 流霜:飞霜,比喻从空中洒落的月光。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 青枫浦:即双枫浦,在湖南浏阳南。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 扁舟子:指飘荡江湖的游子。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 明月楼:明月映照下的楼阁。这里指楼上的思妇。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 裴回:同“徘徊”。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 离人:指守候在家的思妇。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 玉户帘中卷不去:意思是,月光洒在玉门帘上,欲卷而去之而不得。玉户,用玉装饰的门,也用作门的美称。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 月华:月光。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 流照:照射。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 鸿雁长飞光不度:大雁远飞却不能飞出月光。暗示鸿雁不能传书。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 鱼龙潜跃水成文:鱼儿出没只能使水面泛出波纹。暗示鱼儿不能传书。古人有鱼儿传书一说。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 潇湘:潇水和湘江,均流入洞庭湖。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 落月摇情满江树:意思是,落月牵动着离人的别愁,将光辉洒满江畔的林木。[/color] ↩︎","post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2024-08-17T06:09:40Z"},{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-07T02:54:16Z","id":10077,"images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[],"plainText":"@Creative_bot 春江花月夜這種唯美的詩,如何讀?你用現代漢語嘗試將其意境轉述出來吧","post_number":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2024-08-07T02:54:16Z"},{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-07T02:54:27Z","id":10079,"images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[],"plainText":"这首诗描绘了一幅春江花月夜的美丽画卷,要体会它的意境,可以从以下几个方面入手: 1. 画面感: 想象一下,春天的夜晚,江水浩瀚,与海平面连成一片,一轮明月从海上升起,月光洒满了江面,随着波浪起伏,波光粼粼,美不胜收。江水蜿蜒流淌,穿过开满鲜花的原野,月光照耀着花林,花瓣上的露珠如同点点白雪,晶莹剔透。 2. 动态感: 诗中“潮水”“明月”“随波”等词语,展现了画面流动的气息,江水奔涌,月光摇曳,花香弥漫,营造出一种生机勃勃、充满活力的氛围。 3. 情感: 诗人借景抒情,表达了对春江花月夜的喜爱和赞美之情。面对如此美景,诗人不禁感叹“何处春江无月明”,暗示着美好事物无处不在,只要用心感受,就能发现生活中的美好。 现代汉语转述: 春天的夜晚,江水浩瀚无垠,与大海连成一片,一轮明月从海平面缓缓升起,月光与潮水相互辉映,美不胜收。月光随着波浪荡漾,绵延千里,仿佛在问:这美丽的春江,哪里没有月光的照耀呢?江水蜿蜒流淌,穿过开满鲜花的原野,月光倾泻而下,花林沐浴在月光中,花瓣上的露珠晶莹剔透,如同点点白雪,美不胜收。","post_number":4,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2024-08-07T02:54:27Z"},{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2025-11-19T06:27:18Z","id":90344,"images":[{"alt":"","classes":"site-icon","height":320,"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/2d4ffebc4bba325abf3444369dd5cfd03e9d6b35.png","width":320},{"alt":"","classes":"thumbnail","height":330,"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/e/efde4f026f8736ad6c23f3447fda376ae7a3f9af.png","width":660}],"like_count":0,"links":[{"has_image":false,"href":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/qrvbic/sylxbs?#%20%E3%80%8A%E9%80%89%E5%BF%85%20%E4%B8%8A%E3%80%8B","text":"pkuschool.yuque.com","title":""}],"plainText":"pkuschool.yuque.com 选必 上 · 北大附中 选必 上","post_number":5,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2025-11-19T06:27:18Z"},{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2025-11-19T06:29:48Z","id":90345,"images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"has_image":false,"href":"https://z-library.sk/book/41748134/f80433/%E9%97%BB%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86-6-%E5%94%90%E8%AF%97%E7%BC%96-%E4%B8%8A.html?ts=0929","text":"z-library.sk","title":""}],"plainText":"z-library.sk 闻一多全集 6 唐诗编 上 | 孔党伯,袁謇正主编, zhu bian Sun Dangbo, Yuan Jianzheng, 闻一多著 , 孙党伯,... Read online or download for free from Z-Library the Book: 闻一多全集 6 唐诗编 上, Author: 孔党伯,袁謇正主编, zhu bian Sun Dangbo, Yuan Jianzheng,, Publisher: 长沙:湖南人民出版社, ISBN: 9787216011105, Year: 1994, Language: Chinese, Format: PDF, Filesize: 57.54 MB","post_number":6,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2025-11-19T06:29:48Z"},{"attachments":[{"classes":"attachment","has_image":false,"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/3OdoGP13qlOuCdwyL8BjEwxpR20.pdf","text":"闻一多全集 06 唐诗编 上(湖北人民出版社1993).pdf","title":""}],"created_at":"2025-11-19T06:40:26Z","id":90353,"images":[],"like_count":1,"links":[{"classes":"attachment","has_image":false,"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/3OdoGP13qlOuCdwyL8BjEwxpR20.pdf","text":"闻一多全集 06 唐诗编 上(湖北人民出版社1993).pdf","title":""}],"plainText":"闻一多全集 06 唐诗编 上(湖北人民出版社1993).pdf (14.0 MB)","post_number":7,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2025-11-19T06:40:26Z"}],"resourceCounts":{"attachment":1,"document":2,"external":3},"resources":[{"href":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QsXuntTYR9ltdcZ0xGd_mSDL_UCJ6hCO/view?usp=sharing","kind":"link","postNumber":1,"text":"drive.google.com"},{"href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%98%a5%e6%b1%9f%e8%8a%b1%e6%9c%88%e5%a4%9c%e5%bc%a0%e8%8b%a5%e8%99%9a","kind":"link","postNumber":1,"text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8f%a4%e5%85%b8%e8%af%97%e6%ad%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%84%8f%e8%b1%a1/%e6%98%a5%e6%b1%9f%e8%8a%b1%e6%"},{"href":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/qrvbic/sylxbs?#%20%E3%80%8A%E9%80%89%E5%BF%85%20%E4%B8%8A%E3%80%8B","kind":"link","postNumber":5,"text":"pkuschool.yuque.com"},{"href":"https://z-library.sk/book/41748134/f80433/%E9%97%BB%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86-6-%E5%94%90%E8%AF%97%E7%BC%96-%E4%B8%8A.html?ts=0929","kind":"link","postNumber":6,"text":"z-library.sk"},{"href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/3OdoGP13qlOuCdwyL8BjEwxpR20.pdf","kind":"document","postNumber":7,"text":"闻一多全集 06 唐诗编 上(湖北人民出版社1993).pdf"}],"schemaVersion":"yw-native-lesson-v1","sourceTitle":"高中語文 - 春江花月夜/张若虚","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文选择性必修_上册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文选择性必修 上册（人教版）","contextPageImages":[{"bytes":110740,"href":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p87.webp","label":"p87","matched":false,"mediaType":"image/webp","page":87,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-for-bdfz-yw-app-2026-07-29","sha256":"8423c3f34209a765fa2d8f74da11b9ffb9728de98548531edabf5538947b110d","sourceLocalRef":"textbook_ai_migration/platform/frontend/assets/pages/47e3538c5b76/p87.webp","sourceUrl":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p87.webp"},{"bytes":130708,"href":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p88.webp","label":"p88","matched":false,"mediaType":"image/webp","page":88,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-for-bdfz-yw-app-2026-07-29","sha256":"03e20226f03db617f24bde62e9ca402ede10f2a9420c1ca391e54ae69a2fb8a9","sourceLocalRef":"textbook_ai_migration/platform/frontend/assets/pages/47e3538c5b76/p88.webp","sourceUrl":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p88.webp"},{"bytes":147798,"href":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p89.webp","label":"p89","matched":false,"mediaType":"image/webp","page":89,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-for-bdfz-yw-app-2026-07-29","sha256":"e7e34a095d0f8dfa46270c384c06cc7424e441fecba01be420e0431c3cdc51b4","sourceLocalRef":"textbook_ai_migration/platform/frontend/assets/pages/47e3538c5b76/p89.webp","sourceUrl":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/47e3538c5b76/p89.webp"},{"bytes